OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FGenerally fine and dry with
OL,6,Fplenty of sunshine. However, the odd
OL,7,Fshower can't be ruled out,
OL,8,Fparticularly on the coast. Blustery
OL,9,Fwinds expected along the coast, easing
OL,10,Fthrough the afternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FRemaining dry with variable
OL,13,Fcloud, allowing some good spells of
OL,14,Fevening sunshine. The winds will ease
OL,15,Ffurther, becoming generally light.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
