OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FDry but quite cloudy to start,
OL,6,Fbreaking up through the morning. Then
OL,7,Fa mixture of sunshine and outbreaks of
OL,8,Frain from mid-morning, into the
OL,9,Fafternoon. Blustery winds developing.
OL,10,FVery warm.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FMostly
OL,13,Fdry Monday, with rain and strong winds
OL,14,Fspreading in during the evening.
OL,15,FSunshine and showers on Tuesday, with
OL,16,Fgusty winds. Showers and strong winds
OL,17,Fdying away Wednesday morning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
